# 6. Moto — AWS Practice Environment

**Moto** is a Python library used to mock AWS services.

It allows us to practice Boto3 without sending requests to real AWS.

### Real AWS

```text
Python
  ↓
Boto3
  ↓
Internet
  ↓
AWS
  ↓
S3
```

### Using Moto

```text
Python
  ↓
Boto3
  ↓
Moto
  ↓
Mock AWS
  ↓
S3
```

### Install Moto

```bash
pip install moto
```

### Import

```python
from moto import mock_aws
```

### Start Mock AWS

```python
with mock_aws():
    # AWS practice code
```

