# 17. S3 Object Key

An S3 object has a **Key**.

The Key identifies the object within the bucket.

Example:

```python
{
    "Key": "test.txt"
}
```

Here:

```text
Key = test.txt
```

### More Examples

```text
photos/cat.jpg
backups/database.sql
logs/server.log
documents/resume.pdf
```

These are S3 object keys.

